ur ship is hit by enemy attacks, the shield decreases. If you avoid subsequent damage, the shield automatically recovers. When the shield gauge runs out due to continuous damage, the condition gauge decreases. Condition also recovers automatically but requires more energy. If the condition gauge runs out, your ship will be destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/89fe97b71601a0221873cafe4b3ee3fc.poster.avif?t=1767325456\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/89fe97b71601a0221873cafe4b3ee3fc.webm?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/89fe97b71601a0221873cafe4b3ee3fc.mp4?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch between the two ships, Luludi and Asteri, with different equipment at any time. Power-ups are performed individually, allowing for strategic play such as switching to balance power-ups or swapping early during a pinch to wait for recovery opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/3b9bc8f1291b95e482988d1c704cf539.poster.avif?t=1767325456\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/3b9bc8f1291b95e482988d1c704cf539.webm?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/3b9bc8f1291b95e482988d1c704cf539.mp4?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the smooth movements powered by physics calculations and the deformed journey through the solar system as you fight off the giant virus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/11a6b70b0b383f9f9f7ed80c1fcc71b5.poster.avif?t=1767325456\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/11a6b70b0b383f9f9f7ed80c1fcc71b5.webm?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/11a6b70b0b383f9f9f7ed80c1fcc71b5.mp4?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are both normal and difficult routes prepared for each stage, catering to a wide range of players. If the normal route becomes unsatisfying, try searching for the hidden challenging route!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/3e12fa29083a3d5ea8db03c6656a0139.poster.avif?t=1767325456\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/3e12fa29083a3d5ea8db03c6656a0139.webm?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/extras/3e12fa29083a3d5ea8db03c6656a0139.mp4?t=1767325456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["\u661f\u82b1\ud83c\udf38\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u958b\u767a","\u661f\u82b1"],"dlc":[3857690,3869780],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419770/29fbc29f751c0afe9812e049deea41da4e765e29/header.jpg?t=1767325456","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"